# Copy to .env.local (already gitignored). These are OAuth App client IDs —
# not secret, safe in a client bundle — used to build the "Sign in with
# GitHub/GitLab" redirect URL. The matching client *secret* never goes here;
# see .dev.vars.example instead, it's read only by the Pages Function that
# exchanges the OAuth code for a token.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_GITLAB_CLIENT_ID=
